Third-party notice - Stanford Javascript Crypto Library (SJCL)

Six source files of @awacloud/fw are adapted from the Stanford Javascript
Crypto Library (SJCL):

  src/crypto/cipher/aes.js (T-table precomputation, key schedule, T-table
    block path)
  src/crypto/hash/sha256.js
  src/crypto/hash/sha512.js
  src/crypto/pkc/ecc.js (point arithmetic, curve registry, key / ECDSA
    scaffolding)
  src/crypto/utils/bitArray.js
  src/crypto/utils/bn.js

